  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPGRO - Deliver robust and accessible evidence on the physical, social and economic opportunities and constraints to sustainable, long-term groundwater use by the poor in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UPGRO - Deliver robust and accessible evidence on the physical, social and economic opportunities and constraints to sustainable, long-term groundwater use by the poor in Africa is a component of UPGRO - Unlocking the Potential of Groundwater for the Poor reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xa3;2,125,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Research/scientific institutions, Water sector policy and administrative management, Water resources conservation (including data collection), Environmental research.</narrative>
  </description>
